01:10:40,000 --> 01:10:46,000
A Perfect Day is a 2015 Spanish comedy-drama film written
and directed by Fernando León de Aranoa.

11
01:17:44,000 --> 01:17:50,000
It is based on the novel Dejarse Llover by Paula Farias.

12
01:24:48,000 --> 01:24:54,000
It was screened in the Directors' Fortnight section at the 2015 Cannes
Film Festival and is the director's English-language debut.

13
01:31:52,000 --> 01:31:58,000
The film explores themes of bosnia and herzegovina, road trip,
bosnian war (1992-95), united nations, 1990s.

14
01:38:56,000 --> 01:39:02,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
